{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38612","headline":"富水驿东楹有人题诗 · 吴融","name":"富水驿东楹有人题诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绣缨霞翼两鸳鸯，金岛银川是故乡。\n只合双飞便双死，岂悲相失与相忘。\n烟花夜泊红蕖腻，兰渚春游碧草芳。\n何事遽惊云雨别，秦山楚水两乖张。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《才调集》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/才調集_(四庫全書本)）"}